      "content": "Our bladder cancer cohort has whole-exome somatic mutation calls for 140 tumours, and I also have gene exon lengths, a list of cancer driver genes and a GMT file of pathways. I'd like to see which clusters of patients emerge when tumours are compared by how their pathways are mutated, testing between 2 and 6 clusters."
