    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Previous NetZoo goal: Previous NetZoo goal: Our bladder cancer cohort has whole-exome somatic mutation calls for 140 tumours, and I also have gene exon lengths, a list of cancer driver genes and a GMT file of pathways. I'd like to see which clusters of patients emerge when tumours are compared by how their pathways are mutated, testing between 2 and 6 clusters.\nUser follow-up: I'm after patient clusters based on pathway mutations, 2 to 6 of them, for the 140 bladder tumours.\nUser follow-up: One cluster per patient is what I had in mind, with no patient counted in two clusters."
